WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.210
A sprinter crosses the
finish line and stops.

2
00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:05.090
Her race is over.

3
00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:08.770
Yet she keeps panting hard
for minutes afterwards.

4
00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:10.210
She isn't running any more,

5
00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:13.810
so why does she still need
so much extra oxygen?

6
00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:17.110
In this mission, you'll see
how respiration releases energy

7
00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:19.700
from glucose in every living cell.

8
00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:23.290
You'll build the word equation
for aerobic respiration.

9
00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:26.450
And you'll find out what muscles
do when they run short of

10
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.650
oxygen, and where
lactic acid comes in.

11
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:34.020
Your mission: find out what the
sprinter's body is paying back.
